<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - DST Systems outperform repeated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - DST Systems outperform repeated.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Gruntal &amp; Co said Tuesday it repeated its outperform rating on DST Systems Inc.</p>
<p>-- Gruntal said the stock has hit its 12-month price target range of $35 to $39 a share twice in the past year, and may do so again in the months ahead.</p>
<p>-- DST shares were up 5/8 at 30-1/2.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
